# ECHO Optimization

This is a migration of Drone Optimizer v0.7. Treat v0.7 numerical behavior as the reference.

- Do not rewrite formulas, constraints, scoring, cache invalidation, or lock behavior in `optimizer/`.
- Do not `pip install pythrust` from PyPI. Use the local `legacy/streamlit/pythrust` package (setuav-pythrust 0.2.2).
- Do not commit private data: `component_warehouse.sqlite`, propulsion caches, `legacy/streamlit/pythrust/`, `data/private/**`, `.venv`, `node_modules`.
- Each Cloud Agent must work on its own branch. Do not force-push `main`. Do not reuse another agent's branch.
- Tagline copy: "Lock what you know. Optimize what you don't."

Data root: `DRONE_OPTIMIZER_DATA_ROOT` (default `legacy/streamlit`).
API: `127.0.0.1:43127`. UI: `127.0.0.1:43128`.
See `docs/cloud-agents.md`.
